  "description": "If you're looking to explore some new trails, expand your weekly ride routes, and have some fun doing it, the EP-ARROW10 has the perfect blend of long endurance and power to give you the ride of your life.\n\nThe frame was constructed from Aluminum Alloy, which is equal parts, strong, lightweight, and incredibly responsive.\n\nThe design of the frame is designed according to the human body mechanics.\n\nTogether with the dual cylinder hydraulic disk brake and high strength suspesion fork, you will enjoy a comfortable riding experience.\n\nThis Ebike adopts the 48V 20Ah Lithium-Ion battery, 500W high speed geared motor, empowering each and with more speed, more freedom and more fun.\n\nWhether you’re looking for a faster commute, a more effective workout or enhanced weekend riding thrills, the EP-ARROW10 is first choice of a cost-effective electric bicycle.",
